{
  "about": "Amr's companion scenes N01-N10: short stories, most with a small colleague beside him, drawn whole (sheets 1536 x 1024, eight 384 x 512 slots, slot 1 Amr alone as calibration). They are a separate, additive group: scripts/build-mascot-scenes.py builds them as baked scenes (one uniform scale per sheet from slot 1, Amr-only feet anchor, no head, skin, clothes or hair correction, so a cameo's own colours are never read as his), and scripts/build-mascot-packs.py keeps their packs as they are. The N ids are the art package's names (AMR_Sprites.zip, 2026-11-10); since 2026-11-15 the sheets are the refined release's (Amr_Refined_Original_124.zip, every Amr redrawn whole from the approved standing master; docs/mascot/refined-original-release.json); they take no S number. `slots` are slots 2-8. `segments` and `gate` say when each part may truthfully play (engine/companion-scenes.ts).",
